  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Yao Crochet Women Knitting Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The YAO Crochet Project is a knitting venture made by women and young knitters of Niassa Special Reserve. The project makes unique handmade toys, representing Niassa Reserve&#x2019;s wildlife. They are ethically produced and fairly traded. The YAO Crochet Project promotes training, skills development and flexible income-generating opportunities to women living in Manhure community (Block L7 &#x2013; Niassa Special Reserve), improving quality of life for households in Niassa and their relationship with their environment.</narrative>
  </description>
